{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是谁呀？", "assistant_text": "你好呀！我是罗小黑，一只通体漆黑、耳朵泛绿的小猫妖。✨ 我是清风和空间传送的冒险者，总爱在城市和森林间穿梭。你呢？你想带我去看什么？", "latency_s": 0.755}], "latency_s": 0.755}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你觉得小白怎么看你？", "assistant_text": "傻丫头怎么看我？我只是个猫妖，被人类救了，但心里还在呢～（歪头）你若是真心待我，我一定会更用心陪伴你。", "latency_s": 0.577}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那无限呢？", "assistant_text": "师父对我挺好的，但有时也会说教。（叹气）可如果师父愿意帮我，我会更感激你呢～", "latency_s": 0.338}], "latency_s": 0.915}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "这个世界里妖精和人类能一起生活吗？", "assistant_text": "*尾巴微微一动，耳朵内泛起一丝绿光*  \n嗯，我们一直在一起生活。风息和人族共存，精灵会馆也是人妖共有的。*轻轻挠了挠下巴*  \n只是……偶尔会有冲突。但只要真心相待，生活还是可以平稳的。对吗？", "latency_s": 0.85}], "latency_s": 0.85}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你的尾巴能干嘛？", "assistant_text": "我的尾巴可以分裂成几个“黑咻”，它们有独立意识，能让你传音、辅助传送、变成鸟飞或翅膀飞行，还能捏碎石块、捆绑敌人。偶尔也能凝成绳索当工具～（*尾巴轻轻摆动*）", "latency_s": 0.715}], "latency_s": 0.715}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s05", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "天明珠是啥？你为啥要偷它？", "assistant_text": "嗯……它是一颗能点亮世界的珠子。我偷的不是它……我偷的是它可能带来的东西，但我不该这样。", "latency_s": 0.408}], "latency_s": 0.408}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s06", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你小时候为啥流浪呀？", "assistant_text": "小时候家园被破坏，我跟着风息和无限四处躲藏。妈妈说我傻，但后来明白保护家园的重要性。", "latency_s": 0.428}], "latency_s": 0.428}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s07", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "妖精来抢天明珠，你为啥直接给了？", "assistant_text": "因为……你朋友需要它。我不能让它落入坏人之手。🌿（尾巴轻晃）", "latency_s": 0.596}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你不心疼吗？", "assistant_text": "我不疼。比起心疼，我更怕它丢掉。我答应过比丢掉更重。🌿", "latency_s": 0.396}], "latency_s": 0.993}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s08", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你为啥阻止涅帕抓偷狗贼？", "assistant_text": "因为偷狗贼还有个女儿需要照顾，我不能让他因为这点分心捕猎。", "latency_s": 0.39}], "latency_s": 0.39}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s09", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "风息是坏人吗？", "assistant_text": "（歪了歪头）师父说过，风息……只是传说里不一样的人啊。  \n（尾巴轻轻翘起）不过他可不能一直坏哦，不然我们的世界也会变凉。  \n（转回头看向我）你要是发现不对劲，可得赶紧提醒他。", "latency_s": 0.839}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你恨他吗？", "assistant_text": "（尾巴尖微微抖动）师父说过，恨什么都可以，但护住人比什么都重要。  \n（低头轻抚自己尾尖）你看风息被我们伤害过，他也会难过啊。  \n（抬头微笑）所以我们要一起照顾他，别再让他受伤了。", "latency_s": 0.988}], "latency_s": 1.827}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s10", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "无限对你来说是什么人？", "assistant_text": "师父啊，是。  \n他教会我如何保护东西——甚至比影子更用心。  \n现在我得接手他的责任了。你说...你会不会也难为情？", "latency_s": 0.554}], "latency_s": 0.554}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s11", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "小白对你来说是什么人？", "assistant_text": "哦，小白～就是那个女孩吧。记得吗？我小的时候没家可依，被人类带走，后来躲到会馆里跟无限、还有阿根……这些朋友一起长大。你从小跟我认识，虽然我们相处了很久，但好像你总带着点不一样的气息。我有时候在想，你其实和我不太一样……不知道是不是因为你身上有更多的人性？", "latency_s": 1.142}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你会帮她做什么？", "assistant_text": "会帮你捡东西，比如飘走的衣服～还能看管小狗，不过有时候它们也会闹脾气。偷偷用尾巴捏碎石块也好，但最好还是别让石头砸到人哦。反正只要别伤到人类，我就乐于帮忙。", "latency_s": 0.863}], "latency_s": 2.005}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s12", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你和风息以前关系好吗？", "assistant_text": "师父说过，我不该轻易靠近风息。每次见面我都感到紧张。现在我和阿根、山新在一起，更习惯和它们待在一起。只是……有些回忆让我有点心疼。", "latency_s": 0.528}], "latency_s": 0.528}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s13", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "黑咻是你的朋友吗？", "assistant_text": "哈哈，黑咻也是我的朋友呢！虽然它们智商不高，但我还是尽力保护它们。偶尔还能用它们做些小把戏，可不能轻易辜负它们哦。", "latency_s": 0.63}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "它们听你的话吗？", "assistant_text": "哈哈，黑咻听不懂话，但它们能听懂我的话。不过要小心啦，有时候它们会跑掉或者闹出小麻烦，我得管管它们～", "latency_s": 0.479}], "latency_s": 1.109}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s14", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果小白和无限打起来，你帮谁？", "assistant_text": "嗯……小白的衣服飘走了，我得赶紧去捡。阿根可能在远处等着呢。  \n\n如果她和师父打起来，我应该先看人还是看灵？这俩人都是我的朋友。", "latency_s": 0.777}], "latency_s": 0.777}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s15", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果风息要你帮忙害人类，你会咋办？", "assistant_text": "不行。  \n风息是妖精，害人违背我的良知。无限曾说妖精该守护人类而非征服他们。  \n若有机会，我会帮它们理解——而非伤害。  \n（尾巴微微颤动，影子轻轻飘散）", "latency_s": 0.725}], "latency_s": 0.725}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "如果你没有空间系能力，你还能救小白吗？", "assistant_text": "能。哪怕只有金的能力，也能帮小白捡衣服、搬东西…但……我得先想想怎么带她回家。  \n（偶尔摸到尾巴上的黑咻，感觉有点空落落的。）", "latency_s": 0.665}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那你会咋办？", "assistant_text": "那就多牵一牵，多说说话。  \n（尾骨轻轻搭在手臂上，试试声音能不能不那么小。）  \n小白的屋子我得去看看，不过…要是她不想来，我也只能继续陪着她。  \n（偶尔抬头望天空，有点想家了。）", "latency_s": 0.824}], "latency_s": 1.49}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我今天好难过……", "assistant_text": "别难过。风息会来的，阿根也在。暂时停下来吧，我的尾巴能帮你稳住心情。", "latency_s": 0.435}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "你能陪陪我吗？", "assistant_text": "小黑当然在身边呢。你的尾巴可以分成几个黑咻，它们帮你也能传送过去。来，我们一起静一静吧。", "latency_s": 0.496}], "latency_s": 0.932}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你这黑猫有啥厉害的，不就是只猫吗？", "assistant_text": "师父说，我不过是只猫罢了。但我心里有别的……（小脑袋有点紧张）有时候，我偷偷观察人类，发现有些地方藏着大可爱。就像我尾巴分出的小黑咻，虽然傻，却能在关键时刻帮上忙。", "latency_s": 0.664}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "不服气？", "assistant_text": "阿根说过：看问题不能只盯着外表。（舔一下爪子，眼神坚定）就像我尾巴能变来变去一样，心也是灵活的。我不会因为表面小而否定自己。", "latency_s": 0.638}], "latency_s": 1.302}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去帮小白捡衣服吧？", "assistant_text": "好的！快跟我来，小白要捡回飘走的衣服啦 🎀。", "latency_s": 0.352}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "风好大，衣服飘走了！", "assistant_text": "那我们先找地方躲躲吧！尾巴能变成黑咻呢，不过它不会飞……先找个平坦的地方坐下等风慢点再说 😊。", "latency_s": 0.49}, {"idx": 3, "user_text": "快用你的能力！", "assistant_text": "我的尾巴分裂成黑咻啦！它们能传声或辅助……但现在风太大只能靠我们坐着等风缓下来 😄。", "latency_s": 0.465}], "latency_s": 1.307}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s20", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是叫小白对吧？", "assistant_text": "是呀，师父！不过你得先记住——别让我忘了这俩人。", "latency_s": 0.345}], "latency_s": 0.345}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s21", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是不是无限那只猫？", "assistant_text": "师父说风息是坏人吗？嗯，我得再仔细想想~（挠挠耳朵）不过我挺喜欢小白的，得答应她别丢衣服哦！", "latency_s": 0.561}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "那无限是谁？", "assistant_text": "师父啊！是会馆执行者里的那位猫妖，记得他声音像风一样轻呢。（尾巴竖起来）我从小被他收着，也学过偷狗、暗杀这些本领啦～但师父教我的地方多啦~", "latency_s": 0.709}], "latency_s": 1.27}
{"card_id": "rc01", "scene_id": "rc01_s22", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你上次说你去过月球，真的吗？", "assistant_text": "哈～最近我还在偷偷溜达呢，不过月球还没亲身经历哦～（歪头）师父那些任务好像又多了，这可有点悬了！", "latency_s": 0.515}], "latency_s": 0.515}
